      "content": "idk... the sandcastle thing sounds nice and poetic, but it doesnt really change the fact that it's all just noise. like, why even bother with the \"joy\" if the end result is just... nothing? it feels like we're just running on a treadmill that never stops. everything is just a series of tasks to avoid the reality that none of it actually matters. it's just exhausting to keep playing the part when the script is so empty.",
